The trained model weights bundled with GlucoEdge,

    android/app/src/main/assets/trend_float.tflite
    android/app/src/main/assets/trend_int8.tflite

(used by both the Android and the iOS application), are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License
(CC BY-NC 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

The weights were trained on DiaData v3 cohorts (Cinar and Maleshkova, Zenodo,
doi:10.5281/zenodo.17285631), which are distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0, and
their INT8 quantization parameters were calibrated on GlucoBench (Weinstock)
validation windows. Provenance and SHA-256 hashes:
android/app/src/main/assets/MODELS.md.

Attribution: credit "GlucoEdge, Mohamed Menasy
(https://github.com/mohamedmenasy/GlucoEdge)" and DiaData as above.

GlucoEdge is a research prototype, not a medical device. The weights are not
intended for diagnosis, monitoring, treatment, dosing, or any other medical
decision, and are provided as-is, without warranty (Section 5 of the license).
